Error: Cycle detected in dependencies: Adding dependency ID-REDACTED -> ID-REDACTED would create a cycle
Hint: Remove one dependency to break the cycle. Note: epic containment participates in blocking cycles — depending on an epic implies depending on its entire subtree, so the cycle may traverse ID-REDACTED edges that the message does not list (see docs/CLI_REFERENCE.md, `dep add`)
